{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer cooperative deckbuilder where you defend your town in card-based battles and steal your enemies' best cards. Close all the portals to win! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Digital Collectible Card Game Combat</i>: Play minions, actions, items, and trigger cards to fight your way to victory in each match. Use combos, removal, and board wipes to gain and keep control of the board. Start each match with 1 energy per turn and escalate to 10 energy. Build a deck with a good energy distribution to enable victory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dynamic Rules Engine</i>: Cards can evolve over the course of a game. Upgrade and modify your cards in unique and unpredictable ways. Every run is truly different, with millions of possibilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Cooperative Multiplayer</i>: Play with your friends online and coordinate strategies to achieve victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Optimize Your Town</i>: Build and optimize your town to withstand the enemy's onslaught. Build defenses, production units, and buildings that enhance your deckbuilding capabilities.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3029050?t=1740864286","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029050/ed6a919fbebf534c98278356b3be8a943c41d370/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740864286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029050/fe23c8de098c453b783e4ae9bf611d2cb7bad901/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740864286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029050/fe23c8de098c453b783e4ae9bf611d2cb7bad901/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740864286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-